      "correctAnswer": 3,
      "persona": "Whitehat Hacker",
      "taskMessage": "<b>Dana Osei:</b> I am about to put this in front of the people who sign the checks, and their first move will be to ask whether the utility was simply wrong.\n\nOne utility's word does not survive that room. Two separate pieces of software, written by different people, arriving at the same answer does.",
      "taskInstructions": "Run <b>msfconsole sunrpc</b> in the terminal and check its listing against what rpcinfo returned.",
      "taskQuestion": "Why confirm the portmapper finding with a second tool?",
